OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStorm Austen
OL,6,Fbrings wet and windy weather, the
OL,7,Fstrongest winds initially along the
OL,8,Fsouth coast where isolated gales are
OL,9,Fpossible. There may be occasional lull
OL,10,Fin winds in the early hours before
OL,11,Ffurther gales push into Cornwall
OL,12,Faround dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FRain to start for all areas
OL,15,Fbefore pushing away to the northeast
OL,16,Fthrough the morning. Strong winds
OL,17,Fcontinuing through the day with gales
OL,18,Falong coasts and exposed areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
